<title>NEW ZEALAND: Warehouse to release 4-mth result on Oct 4.</title>
<headline>Warehouse to release 4-mth result on Oct 4.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warehouse Group Ltd said on Wednesday it would release its four month result to July 31 at 8.30 a.m. on Friday. -- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
